12 Mighty Orphans is a 2021 American sports film which was directed by Ty
Roberts from a screenplay by Roberts, Lane Garrison and Kevin Meyer.

11
01:12:06,666 --> 01:12:12,666
It is based upon the non-fiction book Twelve Mighty Orphans: The Inspiring True
Story of the Mighty Mites Who Ruled Texas Football by Jim Dent.

12
01:18:40,000 --> 01:18:46,000
